{"id": "EUVD-2026-59451", "enisaUuid": "f4fc6e7f-e0ac-329e-bdc3-7cc2af64538a", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: hci_qca: fix NULL pointer dereference in qca_setup() for non-serdev device\n\nhu->serdev is NULL for hci_uart attached via non-serdev paths, but\nqca_setup() unconditionally calls serdev_device_get_drvdata(hu->serdev)\nand dereferences the result, causing a NULL pointer dereference.\n\nFix by guarding the dereference with a NULL check, consistent with the\nrest of qca_setup().", "datePublished": "2026-08-15T05:58:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-25T14:44:24", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/74f179e75ab03bdc818a5e9709d8a8440c351463", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0704c04769ccc1a0939682db35d816dfa5fe75dc", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3ec629fee178d429f01ae843e4ea888de93012bf"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-74304", "GHSA-3qvf-qw9p-g662"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2280d525-05b3-3465-bbae-386ef3951922", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.0"}, {"id": "6f22fc10-7aae-342d-b1ab-1e484b077478", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "7dfc97da-89aa-3a67-acf8-337b66e2d110", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7812a441617ad7cf3e62281d3fa518d2ba17c100 <74f179e75ab03bdc818a5e9709d8a8440c351463"}, {"id": "a4b31a1f-79dd-37b8-9406-000e93bdf691", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "b8d5afd6-d803-3b1f-b1e1-ef8e1419509d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "22d893eec0d52fa97d25d3de248285648f26ef68 <0704c04769ccc1a0939682db35d816dfa5fe75dc"}, {"id": "cdb436c9-498c-35a3-8a53-5fb24dfb224b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.5"}, {"id": "db21e37b-9e1c-3be8-875f-93e71bb704de", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "22d893eec0d52fa97d25d3de248285648f26ef68 <3ec629fee178d429f01ae843e4ea888de93012bf"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c4d8bd0d-f3e3-3d57-a632-d9e474ec3590", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}